MATCHES byte-for-byte with agbcc -mno-thumb-interwork -O2 (verified via try_compiler). C:
extern void sub_080645EC(u32*,u32*); extern s32 sub_08064DC8(u32*,u32*); typedef struct {u32 a,b;} Pair;
void sub_08064EC8(Pair p0,Pair p1){u32 res[2][5]; sub_080645EC((u32*)&p0,res[0]); sub_080645EC((u32*)&p1,res[1]); sub_08064DC8(res[0],res[1]);}
Key: the two 8-byte args are by-value Pair structs (GCC spills r0-r3 to sp+0x28..0x34 then takes addresses at each call). callee is sub_080645EC, not _080645EC.

MATCHES byte-for-byte with agbcc -mno-thumb-interwork -O2. C:
s32 sub_08064EF4(Pair p0,Pair p1){u32 res[2][5]; u32 c0,c1; sub_080645EC((u32*)&p0,res[0]); sub_080645EC((u32*)&p1,res[1]); c0=(res[0][0]<=1U); if(c0) return 1; c1=(res[1][0]<=1U); if(!c1) return sub_08064DC8(res[0],res[1]); return 1;}
Needs two separate bool locals c0,c1 and early return to get the materialized 'movs r1,#0' for each. Only default-flag diff is epilogue.

MATCHES byte-for-byte with agbcc -mno-thumb-interwork -O2. C:
void sub_080651AC(Pair p){u32 res[5]; sub_080645EC((u32*)&p,res); res[1]=!res[1]; sub_080644A4(res);}
res[1]=!res[1] produces movs r1,#0 / cmp / movs r1,#1 / str.
